  offerLine: That wasn't me. I didn't take that. Which ring? Where'd you get that? Give it here. No, fine, don't.
  activeLine: I've never seen that ring in my life. Show me again.
  readyLine: All right. All RIGHT. I nicked it years ago, off Snail's gran. Then I dropped it. Then I felt bad. Take it back, would you? Tell Snail I'm sorry. Actually, don't.
  doneLine: I'm not talking about it.
